## 5. `include/strata/core/conversation_buffer.hpp` — Snapshot-Owned Host Storage

**Responsibilities:** Provides a segmented byte buffer (`ConversationBuffer`) that never relocates existing payloads on append, supports `visit()` for zero-copy transfer, geometric segment growth bounded at 16 MiB, and `allocation_peak()` for pre-admission sizing.

**Proposed change:** Add a `shrink_to_fit()` method that releases trailing empty segments and compacts the final segment to its exact size, reducing memory held by parked conversations.

```diff
--- a/include/strata/core/conversation_buffer.hpp
+++ b/include/strata/core/conversation_buffer.hpp
@@ -108,6 +108,14 @@
     bool operator==(const ConversationBuffer& other) const {
         if (size_ != other.size_) return false;
         size_t a = 0, b = 0, x = 0, y = 0;
+        while (a < segments_.size() && b < other.segments_.size()) {
+            const auto& left = segments_[a];
+            const auto& right = other.segments_[b];
+            const size_t n = std::min(left.size() - x, right.size() - y);
+            if (std::memcmp(left.data() + x, right.data() + y, n)) return false;
+            x += n; y += n;
+            if (x == left.size()) { ++a; x = 0; }
+            if (y == right.size()) { ++b; y = 0; }
+        }
+        return true;
+    }
+    /// Release trailing empty segments and shrink the last segment to its exact size.
+    void shrink_to_fit() {
+        while (!segments_.empty() && segments_.back().empty()) segments_.pop_back();
+        if (!segments_.empty()) segments_.back().shrink_to_fit();
+    }
+
+private:
+    using Segment = std::vector<uint8_t>;
+    static size_t segment_capacity(size_t count, size_t previous, bool growing) {
+        if (!growing) return count;
+        return std::max(count, std::min(segment_bytes, std::max<size_t>(65536, std::min(previous, segment_bytes/2)*2)));
+    }
+    static bool add(size_t& n, size_t extra) {
+        if (extra > SIZE_MAX - n) return false;
+        n += extra;
+        return true;
+    }
+    template<class Self, class Fn> static bool visit_impl(Self& self, size_t offset, size_t count, Fn fn) {
+        if (offset > self.size_ || count > self.size_ - offset) return false;
+        size_t begin = 0;
+        for (auto& segment : self.segments_) {
+            if (!count) break;
+            const size_t end = begin + segment.size();
+            if (offset < end) {
+                const size_t n = std::min(count, end - offset);
+                if (!fn(segment.data() + offset - begin, n, offset)) return false;
+                offset += n; count -= n;
+            }
+            begin = end;
+        }
+        return count == 0;
+    }
+    std::vector<Segment> segments_;
+    size_t size_ = 0;
+};
+
+} // namespace strata::core
```

**Verification cases:**
1. Create a buffer, resize to 100 bytes, resize to 0, call `shrink_to_fit()`; confirm `segments_.empty()` and `bytes() == 0`.
2. Create a buffer with 3 segments (16 MiB, 16 MiB, 1 MiB), resize to 33 MiB (dropping the last segment), call `shrink_to_fit()`; confirm the second segment's capacity equals its size.

